<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-BRIDGEND BEAT NEWPORT IN WELSH PREMIER OPENER.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-BRIDGEND BEAT NEWPORT IN WELSH PREMIER OPENER.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT, Wales 1997-08-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bridgend beat Newport 27-19 (halftime 3-19) in a Welsh premier division match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Newport - Tries: Martyn Llewellyn. Conversions: Shaun Connor. Penalties: Connor 4.</p>
<p>Bridgend - Tries: Jonathan Dodd, Matthew Lewis, Steve Wynn. Conversions: Gareth Cull (3). Penalties: Cull 2.</p>
</text>
